      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Iraq&apos;s 2022-2028 National Mine Action Strategy is yet to be formally approved by the Iraqi Government. Iraq&apos;s political stalemate from October 2021 to November 2022 contributed to the delay. With the new President, Prime Minister and Minister of Environment in place, the strategy is expected to be approved during the first quarter of 2023.</narrative>
